    "rating": 4.5,
    "reference": "ChIJg3hzXnI4yUwRIJZcR7D0rtE",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Erick Cabeza Figueroa (Kurdox)",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117090614614575746982/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU99mig8e9Bykplsz0_y_0r-QVFsVm5KF2vzz31KMrmW20bSDV-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "The SAQ in Île-Perrot is a very good liquor store that really has most of what you need. The selection is impressive, covering a wide variety of choices from everyday favorites to more exotic bottles you don’t often find elsewhere. Their whiskey and scotch section is particularly strong, with plenty of great options for both casual drinkers and scotch enthusiasts. Of course, their specialty remains wine, and the range here is really good, whether you’re looking for something affordable or a fine bottle for a special occasion. Overall, it’s a well-stocked store with something for everyone.",
        "time": 1755992839,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andy Singh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113414905356481181802/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXquI8BdvomqXzaoyTvxUKyb2K6UEWS40uJ7Dwr3lLk6GYqsFWSAQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "This place has more choices than most SAQ more exotic choices. Every time I go here I find something I've never seen before!",
        "time": 1721860538,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "russiachand heikham",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111112220381390239257/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoM5dOoaIHgPKjRK5AG1rRXxRW3vM81-Zu8oAKJA1c1fYcopHn=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Well stocks for liquor lover!\nGood place to opt for variety of whisky, scotch, wine, and popular drinks of Asia 🌏 like Sake, Soju, etc.",
        "time": 1655310082,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Anatoli Rouban",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111787037819773131952/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVuqeCMxKqOjWmtgqy3wZv5ny3XGIm9gU4nFqDcmoSfUogF3IYmYw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "The staff is always friendly and eager to assist. Selection fluctuates, but bet the store has little control over it.",
        "time": 1759032733,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Holly Lawson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111125513115170657958/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6LnXSi2RGPxvGrMpYQjF_3JwRxBRwPivsOqmevFpmFfmYjoInpg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "On several occasions I have needed help with selections and the staff have been wonderful.\nPolite, helpful, and bilingual if I needed to switch languages for clarification.\nSuggestions given with explanation of notes.\n\nFrom the moment I walk in, to checking out at the cash.   A++",
        "time": 1738153377,
        "translated": false
      }
